Package: vos-xcalc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: XCalc calculator for V\OS
 XCalc is a graphical RPN calculator: a calculator-style button panel with
 scientific functions, hex/oct/bin number bases, bit operations, keyboard
 input and a multi-language dictionary for the labels.
